{"zh":[{"start":3.15,"end":6.38,"text":"我是康纳·尼克松，NASA 戈达德太空飞行中心的行星科学家，"},{"start":6.4,"end":9.78,"text":"研究外行星的大气成分。"},{"start":9.8,"end":13.98,"text":"土卫六是土星最大的卫星，其实也是太阳系第二大的卫星，"},{"start":14.0,"end":17.88,"text":"也是太阳系唯一一颗有浓厚大气的卫星，"},{"start":17.9,"end":24.56,"text":"那层大气在某些方面和地球的很像，主要由氮组成，但在另一些方面又非常不同。"},{"start":24.58,"end":29.9,"text":"甲烷是含量第二多的气体，它起的作用和地球大气中的水蒸气一样。"},{"start":29.92,"end":34.12,"text":"它从地表蒸发，形成云，然后又降下雨来，"},{"start":34.14,"end":40.98,"text":"事实上还形成了湖，我们在土卫六北极看到了，里面有乙烷、丙烷和各种复杂的化学物质。"},{"start":41.0,"end":48.37,"text":"我们还在赤道看到大片沙丘，它们不像地球上那样由硅酸盐构成，而是由有机物构成，"},{"start":48.39,"end":52.06,"text":"基本上是塑料，它们其实是从大气中沉降下来的，"},{"start":52.08,"end":58.88,"text":"被风吹成沙丘，就和我们在地球沙漠上看到的一样。"},{"start":58.9,"end":63.51,"text":"早在 1980 年，旅行者 1 号飞过土卫六，第一次近距离接触这颗卫星，"},{"start":63.53,"end":68.28,"text":"它在大气中发现了许多新的化学物质，其中很多就是我们说的碳氢化合物，"},{"start":68.3,"end":74.89,"text":"由碳和氢两种原子组成。这些是甲烷被阳光分解后形成的。"},{"start":74.91,"end":81.26,"text":"它会形成越来越长的链状分子。所以你可以先把两个碳连在一起，组成一个分子家族，"},{"start":81.28,"end":87.05,"text":"也可以把三个碳连在一起，组成更重的分子家族。"},{"start":87.07,"end":93.02,"text":"所以很奇怪的是，旅行者号只发现了三碳家族中最重和最轻的成员，"},{"start":93.04,"end":98.61,"text":"却没有找到家族的中间成员丙烯，它缺席了。"},{"start":98.63,"end":103.6,"text":"NASA 有一艘很棒的旗舰探测器叫卡西尼，正在环绕土星运行，"},{"start":103.62,"end":110.73,"text":"它多次近距离飞掠土卫六。在可见光下，土卫六看起来平淡无奇，就像一个橙色的球，"},{"start":110.75,"end":115.58,"text":"但卡西尼有办法看穿那层雾霾，包括复合红外光谱仪 CIRS，"},{"start":115.6,"end":120.9,"text":"它能观察大气发出的热，把它分解成不同的频率，"},{"start":120.92,"end":126.66,"text":"形成特有的峰的图案，给出不同分子的特征信号。"},{"start":126.68,"end":133.06,"text":"这样我们就能检测大气里有哪些分子，旅行者号以前发现的分子我们都看到了。"},{"start":133.08,"end":139.11,"text":"但我们也能寻找新分子，事实上，就在这些含量较多的分子信号里，"},{"start":139.13,"end":144.26,"text":"我们看到一个非常小的尖峰，来自一种以前没见过的新物质，"},{"start":144.28,"end":149.06,"text":"事实上那就是丙烯，我们在土卫六大气的多个高度上都看到了它。"},{"start":149.08,"end":154.3,"text":"把所有信号加在一起后，我们有超过 99% 的把握，我们发现了一种新分子。"},{"start":158.65,"end":162.69,"text":"我手里这个东西，这是聚丙烯。"},{"start":162.71,"end":168.73,"text":"这是我们在地球上日常家用物品里用的一种塑料，比如这个塑料盒，"},{"start":168.75,"end":174.91,"text":"把它翻过来看底部，会找到一个带数字 5 的标志，写着 PP，聚丙烯。"},{"start":174.93,"end":180.88,"text":"这就是我们在土卫六上发现的丙烯，只不过聚合了，也就是分子连成了长链，"},{"start":180.9,"end":186.08,"text":"这些链缠在一起，就形成了一种坚硬透明的塑料，我们用在很多家用物品里。"},{"start":186.1,"end":193.28,"text":"所以意识到我们在太空发现的东西，其实就是我每天在地球上摸到的东西，这对我来说真的很好玩。"},{"start":193.3,"end":196.36,"text":"所以在土卫六上发现丙烯真的很令人兴奋。"},{"start":196.38,"end":203.31,"text":"首先，它补全了这个化学家族，这个缺失的一环要追溯到 32 年前的旅行者号，"},{"start":203.33,"end":207.68,"text":"同时，它也说明土卫六的大气里还有多得多的东西有待发现。"},{"start":207.7,"end":214.74,"text":"有些人认为土卫六和很久以前生命出现前的地球很像，那时分子正在形成生命的基础。"},{"start":214.76,"end":220.58,"text":"我们不知道，如果再派探测器带着新的、更灵敏的仪器去土卫六，会发现什么，"},{"start":220.6,"end":226.24,"text":"会不会有些土卫六上的分子和地球生命的基础相似。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":3.15,"end":6.38,"text":"I'm Conor Nixon, I'm a planetary scientist at NASA's Goddard Space Flight Center,","words":[["I'm","我是"],["Conor","康纳"],["Nixon,","尼克松"],["I'm","我是"],["a","一名"],["planetary","行星"],["scientist","科学家"],["at","在"],["NASA's","NASA的"],["Goddard","戈达德"],["Space","太空"],["Flight","飞行"],["Center,","中心"]]},{"start":6.4,"end":9.78,"text":"and I study the atmospheric composition of the outer planets.","words":[["and","和"],["I","我"],["study","研究"],["the","这"],["atmospheric","大气"],["composition","成分"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["outer","外"],["planets.","行星"]]},{"start":9.8,"end":13.98,"text":"Titan is Saturn's largest moon, it's actually the second-largest moon in the solar system,","words":[["Titan","土卫六"],["is","是"],["Saturn's","土星的"],["largest","最大"],["moon,","卫星"],["it's","它是"],["actually","其实"],["the","这"],["second-largest","第二大"],["moon","卫星"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["solar","太阳"],["system,","系"]]},{"start":14.0,"end":17.88,"text":"and it's the only moon in the solar system that has a large and substantial atmosphere,","words":[["and","而"],["it's","它是"],["the","这"],["only","唯一"],["moon","卫星"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["solar","太阳"],["system","系"],["that","那"],["has","有"],["a","一个"],["large","大"],["and","和"],["substantial","浓厚"],["atmosphere,","大气"]]},{"start":17.9,"end":24.56,"text":"and that atmosphere in some respects is really similar to that of the Earth, being composed mainly of nitrogen, but in other respects it's really different.","words":[["and","而"],["that","那"],["atmosphere","大气"],["in","在"],["some","一些"],["respects","方面"],["is","是"],["really","真的"],["similar","相似"],["to","于"],["that","那"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["Earth,","地球"],["being","是"],["composed","组成"],["mainly","主要"],["of","的"],["nitrogen,","氮"],["but","但"],["in","在"],["other","其他"],["respects","方面"],["it's","它是"],["really","真的"],["different.","不同"]]},{"start":24.58,"end":29.9,"text":"It has methane as the second-most abundant gas, and that takes the same role as water vapor in the Earth's atmosphere.","words":[["It","它"],["has","有"],["methane","甲烷"],["as","作为"],["the","这"],["second-most","第二多"],["abundant","丰富"],["gas,","气体"],["and","而"],["that","那"],["takes","担任"],["the","这"],["same","同样"],["role","角色"],["as","像"],["water","水"],["vapor","蒸气"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["Earth's","地球的"],["atmosphere.","大气"]]},{"start":29.92,"end":34.12,"text":"It evaporates from the surface, it forms clouds, and then rains down again","words":[["It","它"],["evaporates","蒸发"],["from","从"],["the","这"],["surface,","表面"],["it","它"],["forms","形成"],["clouds,","云"],["and","而"],["then","然后"],["rains","降雨"],["down","下"],["again","再"]]},{"start":34.14,"end":40.98,"text":"and in fact forms lakes that we see at Titan's north pole, including ethane and propane and all sorts of complex chemicals.","words":[["and","而"],["in","事实"],["fact","上"],["forms","形成"],["lakes","湖"],["that","那"],["we","我们"],["see","看到"],["at","在"],["Titan's","土卫六的"],["north","北"],["pole,","极"],["including","包括"],["ethane","乙烷"],["and","和"],["propane","丙烷"],["and","和"],["all","所有"],["sorts","种类"],["of","的"],["complex","复杂"],["chemicals.","化学物质"]]},{"start":41.0,"end":48.37,"text":"We also see these vast dune fields at the equator, which are not made of silicates as they are on the Earth but actually made of organic substances,","words":[["We","我们"],["also","也"],["see","看到"],["these","这些"],["vast","广阔的"],["dune","沙丘"],["fields","场"],["at","在"],["the","这"],["equator,","赤道"],["which","它们"],["are","是"],["not","不"],["made","由"],["of","的"],["silicates","硅酸盐"],["as","像"],["they","它们"],["are","是"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["Earth","地球"],["but","而"],["actually","实际"],["made","由"],["of","的"],["organic","有机"],["substances,","物质"]]},{"start":48.39,"end":52.06,"text":"essentially plastics which have actually sedimented from the atmosphere","words":[["essentially","基本上"],["plastics","塑料"],["which","它们"],["have","已"],["actually","实际"],["sedimented","沉降"],["from","从"],["the","这"],["atmosphere","大气"]]},{"start":52.08,"end":58.88,"text":"and are being blown around into dune fields the same as we'd see on a desert on the Earth.","words":[["and","而"],["are","是"],["being","被"],["blown","吹"],["around","四处"],["into","成"],["dune","沙丘"],["fields","场"],["the","这"],["same","同样"],["as","像"],["we'd","我们会"],["see","看到"],["on","在"],["a","一片"],["desert","沙漠"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["Earth.","地球"]]},{"start":58.9,"end":63.51,"text":"Back in 1980 when Voyager 1 flew by Titan and made the first close encounter with that moon,","words":[["Back","回"],["in","在"],["1980","1980年"],["when","当"],["Voyager","旅行者"],["1","1号"],["flew","飞"],["by","经过"],["Titan","土卫六"],["and","和"],["made","做"],["the","这"],["first","第一次"],["close","近"],["encounter","接触"],["with","与"],["that","那"],["moon,","卫星"]]},{"start":63.53,"end":68.28,"text":"it discovered many new chemical species in the atmosphere, and a lot of these are what we call hydrocarbons,","words":[["it","它"],["discovered","发现"],["many","许多"],["new","新"],["chemical","化学"],["species","物质"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["atmosphere,","大气"],["and","而"],["a","一"],["lot","很多"],["of","的"],["these","这些"],["are","是"],["what","什么"],["we","我们"],["call","称"],["hydrocarbons,","碳氢化合物"]]},{"start":68.3,"end":74.89,"text":"which are composed of two types of atom, carbon and hydrogen. And these are derived from methane after the methane is broken apart by sunlight","words":[["which","它们"],["are","是"],["composed","组成"],["of","的"],["two","两"],["types","种"],["of","的"],["atom,","原子"],["carbon","碳"],["and","和"],["hydrogen.","氢"],["And","而"],["these","这些"],["are","是"],["derived","衍生"],["from","从"],["methane","甲烷"],["after","在…后"],["the","这"],["methane","甲烷"],["is","是"],["broken","打碎"],["apart","分开"],["by","被"],["sunlight","阳光"]]},{"start":74.91,"end":81.26,"text":"it forms into longer and longer chain molecules. So you can add first two carbons together to make a family of molecules,","words":[["it","它"],["forms","形成"],["into","成"],["longer","更长"],["and","和"],["longer","更长"],["chain","链"],["molecules.","分子"],["So","所以"],["you","你"],["can","能"],["add","加"],["first","先"],["two","两个"],["carbons","碳"],["together","一起"],["to","去"],["make","组成"],["a","一个"],["family","家族"],["of","的"],["molecules,","分子"]]},{"start":81.28,"end":87.05,"text":"and you can also form three carbons together to form a heavier family of molecules.","words":[["and","而"],["you","你"],["can","能"],["also","也"],["form","形成"],["three","三个"],["carbons","碳"],["together","一起"],["to","去"],["form","组成"],["a","一个"],["heavier","更重"],["family","家族"],["of","的"],["molecules.","分子"]]},{"start":87.07,"end":93.02,"text":"So it was actually very mysterious that Voyager only discovered the heaviest and the lightest members of the three carbon family,","words":[["So","所以"],["it","它"],["was","曾"],["actually","其实"],["very","很"],["mysterious","神秘"],["that","那"],["Voyager","旅行者"],["only","只"],["discovered","发现"],["the","这"],["heaviest","最重"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["lightest","最轻"],["members","成员"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["three","三"],["carbon","碳"],["family,","家族"]]},{"start":93.04,"end":98.61,"text":"but it didn't find the middle member of the family, propylene, that was missing.","words":[["but","但"],["it","它"],["didn't","没"],["find","找到"],["the","这"],["middle","中间"],["member","成员"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["family,","家族"],["propylene,","丙烯"],["that","那"],["was","曾"],["missing.","缺失"]]},{"start":98.63,"end":103.6,"text":"So NASA has this wonderful flagship spacecraft called Cassini which is currently orbiting Saturn,","words":[["So","所以"],["NASA","NASA"],["has","有"],["this","这个"],["wonderful","很棒的"],["flagship","旗舰"],["spacecraft","探测器"],["called","叫"],["Cassini","卡西尼"],["which","它"],["is","是"],["currently","目前"],["orbiting","环绕"],["Saturn,","土星"]]},{"start":103.62,"end":110.73,"text":"and it's making multiple close flybys of Titan. Now in visible light, Titan appears quite bland and featureless just like an orange globe,","words":[["and","而"],["it's","它是"],["making","做"],["multiple","多次"],["close","近"],["flybys","飞掠"],["of","的"],["Titan.","土卫六"],["Now","现在"],["in","在"],["visible","可见"],["light,","光"],["Titan","土卫六"],["appears","显得"],["quite","相当"],["bland","平淡"],["and","和"],["featureless","无特征"],["just","就"],["like","像"],["an","一个"],["orange","橙色"],["globe,","球"]]},{"start":110.75,"end":115.58,"text":"but Cassini has techniques to peer through that haze, including the Composite Infrared Spectrometer or CIRS,","words":[["but","但"],["Cassini","卡西尼"],["has","有"],["techniques","技术"],["to","去"],["peer","窥"],["through","穿过"],["that","那"],["haze,","雾霾"],["including","包括"],["the","这"],["Composite","复合"],["Infrared","红外"],["Spectrometer","光谱仪"],["or","或"],["CIRS,","CIRS"]]},{"start":115.6,"end":120.9,"text":"which can look at the heat coming from the atmosphere and split it apart into its different frequencies,","words":[["which","它"],["can","能"],["look","看"],["at","在"],["the","这"],["heat","热"],["coming","来自"],["from","从"],["the","这"],["atmosphere","大气"],["and","和"],["split","分"],["it","它"],["apart","开"],["into","成"],["its","它的"],["different","不同"],["frequencies,","频率"]]},{"start":120.92,"end":126.66,"text":"and this forms a characteristic pattern of peaks, which give the characteristic signatures of different molecules.","words":[["and","而"],["this","这"],["forms","形成"],["a","一个"],["characteristic","特有的"],["pattern","图案"],["of","的"],["peaks,","峰"],["which","它"],["give","给"],["the","这"],["characteristic","特有的"],["signatures","信号"],["of","的"],["different","不同"],["molecules.","分子"]]},{"start":126.68,"end":133.06,"text":"And through this we can detect which molecules are in the atmosphere, and we see all the molecules that were previously discovered by Voyager.","words":[["And","而"],["through","通过"],["this","这"],["we","我们"],["can","能"],["detect","检测"],["which","哪些"],["molecules","分子"],["are","是"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["atmosphere,","大气"],["and","和"],["we","我们"],["see","看到"],["all","所有"],["the","这"],["molecules","分子"],["that","那"],["were","曾"],["previously","以前"],["discovered","发现"],["by","被"],["Voyager.","旅行者"]]},{"start":133.08,"end":139.11,"text":"But we're also able to look for new molecules, and in fact, buried within the signatures of these more abundant molecular species","words":[["But","但"],["we're","我们是"],["also","也"],["able","能够"],["to","去"],["look","看"],["for","寻找"],["new","新"],["molecules,","分子"],["and","而"],["in","在"],["fact,","事实"],["buried","埋"],["within","在…内"],["the","这"],["signatures","信号"],["of","的"],["these","这些"],["more","更"],["abundant","丰富的"],["molecular","分子"],["species","种类"]]},{"start":139.13,"end":144.26,"text":"we saw a very small spike which was due to a new species which had not been seen before,","words":[["we","我们"],["saw","看到"],["a","一个"],["very","非常"],["small","小"],["spike","尖峰"],["which","它"],["was","曾"],["due","由于"],["to","于"],["a","一种"],["new","新"],["species","物质"],["which","它"],["had","曾"],["not","没"],["been","被"],["seen","看到"],["before,","以前"]]},{"start":144.28,"end":149.06,"text":"and in fact this was propylene, and we saw it at multiple altitudes in Titan's atmosphere.","words":[["and","而"],["in","在"],["fact","事实"],["this","这"],["was","曾"],["propylene,","丙烯"],["and","而"],["we","我们"],["saw","看到"],["it","它"],["at","在"],["multiple","多个"],["altitudes","高度"],["in","在"],["Titan's","土卫六的"],["atmosphere.","大气"]]},{"start":149.08,"end":154.3,"text":"When we added all the signal together, we had more than 99% confidence that we were discovering a new molecule.","words":[["When","当"],["we","我们"],["added","加"],["all","所有"],["the","这"],["signal","信号"],["together,","一起"],["we","我们"],["had","有"],["more","多"],["than","于"],["99%","99%"],["confidence","把握"],["that","那"],["we","我们"],["were","曾"],["discovering","发现"],["a","一种"],["new","新"],["molecule.","分子"]]},{"start":158.65,"end":162.69,"text":"So this object I have right here, this is polypropylene.","words":[["So","所以"],["this","这个"],["object","东西"],["I","我"],["have","有"],["right","就"],["here,","这里"],["this","这"],["is","是"],["polypropylene.","聚丙烯"]]},{"start":162.71,"end":168.73,"text":"This is a plastic that we use on the Earth in everyday household objects such as this plastic tub here,","words":[["This","这"],["is","是"],["a","一种"],["plastic","塑料"],["that","那"],["we","我们"],["use","用"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["Earth","地球"],["in","在"],["everyday","日常"],["household","家用"],["objects","物品"],["such","比如"],["as","如"],["this","这个"],["plastic","塑料"],["tub","盒"],["here,","这里"]]},{"start":168.75,"end":174.91,"text":"and if we turn it over on the bottom, we find a symbol with the number 5 that says PP, polypropylene.","words":[["and","而"],["if","如果"],["we","我们"],["turn","翻"],["it","它"],["over","过来"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["bottom,","底部"],["we","我们"],["find","找到"],["a","一个"],["symbol","标志"],["with","带"],["the","这"],["number","数字"],["5","5"],["that","它"],["says","写着"],["PP,","PP"],["polypropylene.","聚丙烯"]]},{"start":174.93,"end":180.88,"text":"This is the propylene that we found on Titan, but polymerized, that means that the molecule is formed into long chains,","words":[["This","这"],["is","是"],["the","这"],["propylene","丙烯"],["that","那"],["we","我们"],["found","发现"],["on","在"],["Titan,","土卫六"],["but","但"],["polymerized,","聚合"],["that","那"],["means","意味着"],["that","那"],["the","这"],["molecule","分子"],["is","是"],["formed","形成"],["into","成"],["long","长"],["chains,","链"]]},{"start":180.9,"end":186.08,"text":"and when these chains are tangled together it forms a hard, clear plastic that we use in many household objects.","words":[["and","而"],["when","当"],["these","这些"],["chains","链"],["are","是"],["tangled","缠"],["together","一起"],["it","它"],["forms","形成"],["a","一种"],["hard,","坚硬"],["clear","透明"],["plastic","塑料"],["that","那"],["we","我们"],["use","用"],["in","在"],["many","许多"],["household","家用"],["objects.","物品"]]},{"start":186.1,"end":193.28,"text":"So that was really fun for me to realize that something that we'd discovered in space was in fact something that I was touching every day on the Earth.","words":[["So","所以"],["that","那"],["was","曾"],["really","真的"],["fun","好玩"],["for","对"],["me","我"],["to","去"],["realize","意识到"],["that","那"],["something","某物"],["that","那"],["we'd","我们已"],["discovered","发现"],["in","在"],["space","太空"],["was","曾"],["in","在"],["fact","事实"],["something","某物"],["that","那"],["I","我"],["was","曾"],["touching","摸"],["every","每"],["day","天"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["Earth.","地球"]]},{"start":193.3,"end":196.36,"text":"So the discovery of propylene on Titan is really exciting.","words":[["So","所以"],["the","这"],["discovery","发现"],["of","的"],["propylene","丙烯"],["on","在"],["Titan","土卫六"],["is","是"],["really","真的"],["exciting.","令人兴奋"]]},{"start":196.38,"end":203.31,"text":"First of all, it completes this chemical family where we had this missing link dating thirty-two years back to Voyager,","words":[["First","首先"],["of","的"],["all,","全"],["it","它"],["completes","补全"],["this","这个"],["chemical","化学"],["family","家族"],["where","那里"],["we","我们"],["had","有"],["this","这个"],["missing","缺失的"],["link","一环"],["dating","追溯"],["thirty-two","三十二"],["years","年"],["back","回"],["to","到"],["Voyager,","旅行者"]]},{"start":203.33,"end":207.68,"text":"but also, it shows that there's much more there still in Titan's atmosphere to be discovered.","words":[["but","但"],["also,","也"],["it","它"],["shows","显示"],["that","那"],["there's","有"],["much","很"],["more","更多"],["there","那里"],["still","仍"],["in","在"],["Titan's","土卫六的"],["atmosphere","大气"],["to","去"],["be","被"],["discovered.","发现"]]},{"start":207.7,"end":214.74,"text":"Some people think that Titan is similar to the prebiotic Earth long ago, when the molecules were forming the basis of life.","words":[["Some","一些"],["people","人"],["think","认为"],["that","那"],["Titan","土卫六"],["is","是"],["similar","相似"],["to","于"],["the","这"],["prebiotic","前生命"],["Earth","地球"],["long","很久"],["ago,","以前"],["when","当"],["the","这"],["molecules","分子"],["were","曾"],["forming","形成"],["the","这"],["basis","基础"],["of","的"],["life.","生命"]]},{"start":214.76,"end":220.58,"text":"And we don't know what we're going to find on Titan if we send back further spacecraft with new instruments, more sensitive instruments,","words":[["And","而"],["we","我们"],["don't","不"],["know","知道"],["what","什么"],["we're","我们是"],["going","将要"],["to","去"],["find","发现"],["on","在"],["Titan","土卫六"],["if","如果"],["we","我们"],["send","派"],["back","回"],["further","更多"],["spacecraft","探测器"],["with","带"],["new","新"],["instruments,","仪器"],["more","更"],["sensitive","灵敏"],["instruments,","仪器"]]},{"start":220.6,"end":226.24,"text":"if some of the molecules on Titan could be similar to the basis of life on Earth.","words":[["if","如果"],["some","一些"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["molecules","分子"],["on","在"],["Titan","土卫六"],["could","能"],["be","是"],["similar","相似"],["to","于"],["the","这"],["basis","基础"],["of","的"],["life","生命"],["on","在"],["Earth.","地球"]]}]}